Hi Wilko,

Konstantin Saurbier wrote on Thu Aug 26, 2004 um 05:47:43PM:
> Tests on AS1200, AS255 and a DS10 will follow in the next few days.=20

I have attached the boot message, the output from srm show config and=20
show device for the ES40. No Problems so far. You can add the ES40 in=20
dual cpu configuration to your list. Oh yes the the errors with the da2=20
disc are no FreeBSD problems, seems to be a faulty disc.

I suggest to add the em driver (for Intel gigabit ethernet cards)  to=20
the GENERIC kernel.

The AS1200 doesn't boot, boot message and srm show config and show=20
device are also attached.

I will try to test the BETA1 on the AS255 and an AS1000A tomorrow.
--=20

Viele Gruesse,

Konstantin Saurbier

